      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_12465967_0512&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_12465967_0512.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140605_12470949_0513&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140605_12470949_0513.jpg&#34;&gt;From: Lu., To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Machens, MO. on July 7, 1910&lt;br&gt;
Postcard Info: Published by Keinthal &amp;amp;Newman, N.Y. Chas. H. Hauff, London, Eng.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don’t expect to be back by Sunday but you can’t tell. Give my best to everyone in Pearl. My address for work and house is Machens, MO. in case of interest.&lt;br&gt;
Lu.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
